About the role
Are you ready to build, scale, and continuously improve a portfolio of high-impact Professional Services in an international environment? Do you combine product expertise with strategic and commercial thinking, and do you get energy from translating complex customer challenges into scalable, customer-focused solutions?
At Parakar , we believe professional services should do more than solve operational challenges. They should provide clients with reliable, compliant, and scalable solutions that support international growth. As Head of Product - Professional Services, you take full ownership of shaping, developing, and strengthening Parakar 's Professional Services portfolio across Europe.
This includes continuing to grow and optimize our Payroll and NRP services, while building and implementing additional service lines such as Accounting, Entity Setup & Management, and other professional services that support our long-term growth strategy.
You will operate at the intersection of product strategy, sales, marketing, operations, technology, and customer value. You translate market developments, customer needs, and regulatory requirements into a competitive and future-proof Professional Services portfolio.
Your mission is to strengthen and expand Parakar 's Professional Services offering, support commercial growth, and continuously improve how our services are positioned, developed, and delivered.
We offer you the opportunity to make a real impact in a fast-growing, international organization where innovation, commercial drive, and operational excellence come together.

What you will do :

• Own and continuously evolve Parakar 's Professional Services portfolio, ensuring our services remain competitive, scalable, and aligned with customer and market needs;

• Continue to grow and strengthen existing services, including Payroll and NRP, while identifying opportunities for new service offerings;

• Build, launch, and implement additional service lines such as Accounting, Entity Setup & Management, and other future services that support Parakar 's growth strategy;

• Develop a profitable and customer-focused portfolio that delivers value to clients and strengthens Parakar 's market position;

• Shape the positioning and go-to-market strategy of Professional Services together with Sales and Marketing;

• Translate customer feedback, market developments, and regulatory changes into new products, service improvements, and commercial opportunities;

• Monitor business performance and identify opportunities to improve growth, profitability, operational efficiency, and customer retention;

• Collaborate closely with teams across Sales, Operations, Legal, Finance, Product, and Leadership to drive innovation, alignment, and successful execution.

• This is a strategic and product-driven role, where you report directly to our COO, in which you own and shape our Professional Services portfolio end-to-end. You are responsible not only for strengthening existing services such as Payroll and NRP, but also for building and implementing new service lines that create additional value for our clients and support Parakar 's growth ambitions.

You combine operational expertise with commercial awareness and a strong understanding of customer needs. You are comfortable navigating different country requirements, aligning stakeholders, and turning complex challenges into clear and scalable solutions.
This is a role where the goalposts are always moving. Regulations, technology, customer expectations, and international business models continue to evolve. You enjoy staying ahead of these developments and are motivated by the fact that the product is never truly finished.
You will have a direct impact on customer success and on the growth, profitability, and market position of Parakar 's Professional Services portfolio.
